  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/gmanunta81/GM.XrmToolBox.UnifiedTranslatorManager",
  "published": "2026-06-22T11:08:23.813Z",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0.3\n\t\t- Assembly Info Fixes\n\t\t1.0.0.2\n\t\t- Assembly Info Fixes\n\t\t1.0.0.1\n\t\t- Initial public release.\n\t\t- Inline target-cell editing with auto-managed Modified flag and yellow highlight.\n\t\t- Excel export/import using only System.IO.Compression + System.Xml (no ClosedXML / OpenXML SDK).\n\t\t- Warning when loading a session against ALL unmanaged metadata.\n\t\t- Built-in Help dialog with step-by-step instructions.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Manage Dataverse / Dynamics 365 metadata translations from one grid, with Excel round-trip.",
